OL,3,GNEWSASurge in horses given up by owners
OL,4,Aas costs rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rising cost of caring for horses is
OL,7,Fputting more owners under financial
OL,8,Fpressure, with an animal welfare
OL,9,Fcharity reporting an increase in horses
OL,10,Fbeing given up.
OL,12,FThe Blue Cross in Burford, Oxfordshire,
OL,13,Fsays the situation has been made more
OL,14,Fdifficult this year by the dry weather,
OL,15,Fleading to hay shortages and more
OL,16,Fexpensive food prices.
OL,18,FThe site is currently taking in 20 to
OL,19,F30 horses a month, and the charity
OL,20,Facross the UK saying it has seen a
OL,21,F"160% surge in relinquished horses in
OL,22,Frecent years".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
