OL,3,GNEWSASurge in horses given up by owners
OL,4,Aas costs rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdmissions coordinator Freya Long says:
OL,7,F"There's no grass, very little hay.
OL,8,FI've started getting an increase in
OL,9,Frequests and I can only imagine it'll
OL,10,Fget higher with the cost of living."
